### IDEA HTTP Client / Postman 联调示例（真实短信需由你主动运行发送请求）
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:17892
@mobile = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PHONE
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_START_RESPONSE
@captcha = REPLACE_WITH_SMS_CODE
@stoken = REPLACE_WITH_VERIFY_RESPONSE
@stuid = REPLACE_WITH_VERIFY_RESPONSE
@mid = REPLACE_WITH_VERIFY_RESPONSE

### 1. 创建流程会话（不发短信）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mihoyo/login/start
Content-Type: application/json

{"mobile":"{{mobile}}","area_code":"+86"}

### 2. 发送短信；若触发人机验证，依据文档处理 challenge 后重试
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mihoyo/login/sms
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{sessionId}}"}

### 3. 提交验证码取得米哈游凭证
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mihoyo/login/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{sessionId}}","captcha":"{{captcha}}"}

### 4. 查询关联原神账号
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mihoyo/game/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"stoken":"{{stoken}}","stuid":"{{stuid}}","mid":"{{mid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn"}

### 查询流程状态（不返回凭证）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mihoyo/login/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{sessionId}}"}

### 清除流程会话（不撤销凭证，不退出网站用户）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mihoyo/login/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{sessionId}}"}
